Hello,

TexLexAn is a project of an open source text analyzer classifier 
summarizer for Linux. All the functionalities are implemented and the 
project is jumping to the alpha status. 

The code is available here: https://sourceforge.net/projects/texlexan/    

The current version accepts English, French and Spanish texts. The linear 
classifier use the perceptron method. The summarizer uses its past 
experiences to select the best summarizing method.


Thanks,

Jean-Pierre Redonnet.

